{"unit_id":"1nsaint__DSH-IDE-Tools#readme-1","repo":"1nsaint/DSH-IDE-Tools","commit":"ac67bb1b9712b68042cdf9287f7d1df64657f934","type":"readme","lang":"en","text":"dsh-ide-tools README · DSH IDE Tools：IDE-style plugins for [DeepSeek Harness](https://github.com/deepseek-ai/deepseek-harness) — Code, Git, Terminal, Containers, Database, Browser, Downloads, Scheduled tasks, SSH workspaces, file sidebar, split view, Lite mode, and more.\n\nRequires a running DeepSeek Harness with **Plugins**. This repo is the plugin suite, not Harness itself.","source":"extracted","section":"DSH IDE Tools"}
{"unit_id":"1nsaint__DSH-IDE-Tools#readme-2","repo":"1nsaint/DSH-IDE-Tools","commit":"ac67bb1b9712b68042cdf9287f7d1df64657f934","type":"readme","lang":"en","text":"dsh-ide-tools README · Install：1. Open **Plugins** in the left sidebar.\n2. Click **Add plugin**.\n3. Paste this URL and click **Install**:\n\n```text\nhttps://github.com/1nsaint/DSH-IDE-Tools\n```\n\n(Shorthand: `github:1nsaint/DSH-IDE-Tools`.)\n\n4. Wait for pnpm to finish, then **hard-refresh** the browser (Ctrl+Shift+R).\n5. Open **Settings** for host-specific bits (LLM / Ollama URL, Browser CDP, metrics, search keys, SSH). Those live in `$DSH_HOME/plugins-data/` and are **not** shipped by the suite.","source":"extracted","section":"Install"}
{"unit_id":"1nsaint__DSH-IDE-Tools#readme-3","repo":"1nsaint/DSH-IDE-Tools","commit":"ac67bb1b9712b68042cdf9287f7d1df64657f934","type":"readme","lang":"en","text":"dsh-ide-tools README · Install：<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"docs/images/01-plugins-panel.png\" alt=\"Plugins panel with Add plugin and installed dsh-ide-tools\" width=\"900\" />\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"docs/images/02-add-plugin-dialog.png\" alt=\"Add plugin dialog with the GitHub repo URL pasted\" width=\"900\" />\n</p>\n\nThe suite installs as one package (`dsh-ide-tools`). Uninstall that row to remove everything.\n\n**One plugin only:**\n\n```text\ngithub:1nsaint/DSH-IDE-Tools#path:plugins/dsh-browser\n```\n\n**Notes**","source":"extracted","section":"Install"}
{"unit_id":"1nsaint__DSH-IDE-Tools#readme-4","repo":"1nsaint/DSH-IDE-Tools","commit":"ac67bb1b9712b68042cdf9287f7d1df64657f934","type":"readme","lang":"en","text":"dsh-ide-tools README · Install：- Not on npm yet — paste the GitHub URL, not bare `dsh-ide-tools`.\n- Optional headed Chromium for Remote Browser is a separate Docker companion — see **Settings → Browser** after install.\n\nMore detail: [`docs/INSTALL.md`](docs/INSTALL.md) · [`docs/FAQ.md`](docs/FAQ.md)","source":"extracted","section":"Install"}
